BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2f1f5262-2098-3d2e-8789-a71dac9e36ff.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
